''[[Dryopteris]]'' (wood fern) is a [[genus]] of [[fern]]s in the family [[Dryopteridaceae]]. They are found worldwide.

{{As of|2026|June}}, the ''Checklist of Ferns and Lycophytes of the World'' recognized about 355 species and 100 hybrids.<ref>{{cite WF |taxon=Dryopteris |access-date=2 June 2026}}</ref>

